                </div>
              </li>
              <li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #09090b; text-align: left;">
                <span style="color: #2A680D; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.4; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
                <div>
                  <strong style="color: #2A680D;">Automated Root Cause Analysis with 24Observe:</strong> Platforms like <a href="https://24observe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2A680D; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; font-weight: 700;">24Observe</a> combine <a href="https://24observe.com/product/uptime" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2A680D; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; font-weight: 700;">uptime monitoring</a>, <a href="https://24observe.com/product/logs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2A680D; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; font-weight: 700;">log management</a>, and <a href="https://24observe.com/product/siem" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2A680D; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; font-weight: 700;">SIEM security detection</a> to give you evidence-backed verdicts in seconds.
                </div>
